  "modelNotes": [
    "Existing50XP anchor card IDs represent ownership of their specialization; preserve IDs and ordinary paid purchase path.",
    "One included anchor choice is a source grant attached to the base vocation; it requires a real quote/grant mechanism to avoid charging50XP twice.",
